sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
send r1 bob rx pro normal line
send r2 bob rx prio=low pro low line
send r3 alice rx basic short
send r4 cora ny prio=high bulk high
advance 5s
invoice bob
invoice alice
invoice cora
export billing
